<item>
<title>Advanced League Battle Arenas</title>
<link>http://xs.xploder.net/xploder/xploderui.asp?un=xdnv2&amp;platformid=1&amp;tab=gc&amp;gameid=14772</link>
<description> Now - these were very hard to find… basically I trained for the menu selector position.  With 0 being pos 0, 1 being pos 1 etc etc…  I did this for arounf two or three menus and discovered that these were in and around 0xd00000 and 0xf00000  I then used a cheat code from the internet to unlock all the levels.  By switching between two states (cheat &amp; no cheat) and just training for not equal to on each pass IN THE DATA AREA LOCAL TO THE MENU POSITION LOCATIONS I was able to find a huge table of longwords that got set to 1 when the cheat was active and 0 when it wasn;t  By experimenting in this area I discovered that it was the level unlock table.  By further experimenting I discovered that filling the table with 2's instead of 1's it unlocked all the levels and they were completed.</description>
